{%- liquid
  comment
    Case-only: on the product page of something that isn't a phone case (a candle, a cloth,
    a charm), this section shows nothing, since it talks about phones, fit or case packs
    (snippets/cv-is-case.liquid). Elsewhere it always shows.
  endcomment
  assign cv_case_page = true
  if template.name == 'product'
    capture cv_is_case
      render 'cv-is-case', product: product
    endcapture
    unless cv_is_case contains 'true'
      assign cv_case_page = false
    endunless
  endif
-%}
{%- if cv_case_page -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Casify product page: the colour carousel.

  A mid-page buying moment for shoppers who scrolled past the buy box. Every
  colour this case is made in rides a 1920s candy-shop merry-go-round (three.js,
  assets/cv-pdp-carousel.js): drag to spin, tap a card, or use the colour chips.
  Picking a colour sets it in the buy box (the same "cvs:choose" event the fit
  list uses), and the buy box answers with "cvs:change", so the price, the pack
  and the button here always match the buy box and the checkout.

  Model fit comes first: the phone list starts unchosen unless the shopper has
  already picked a phone (in the buy box, the fit list or the URL), and "Add to
  bag" asks for the phone before it adds anything. Adding submits the buy box's
  own form, so the chosen pack and any mixed cases go in exactly as they would
  from the top of the page.

  Honest data only: the photos are each colour's own variant photo, the stock
  line counts this product's real variants, and prices come from the variants.
  The stock line says "In stock" only when Shopify tracks the inventory and
  stops selling at zero (the buy box's low-stock rule); otherwise it says
  "Made for [n] phone models", because an untracked or oversold variant is
  always "available". The first-paint was-price is the variant's own
  compare-at price, the buy box's first rule; the buy box's merchant fallback
  lives in that section's settings, which Liquid here cannot read, so the
  script applies it (data-compare-at-fallback) the moment it runs.

  Buttons: "Add to bag" and "Buy now" call window.CasifyPDP.add / buyNow with
  this panel's button as "from", so the buy box posts the chosen pack and the
  bag token flies from here (cv-commerce-motion.js, data-cvm-btn states).
  Buy now shows only when the buy box has one (its show_buy_now setting).
  The pack pills mirror the buy box tiers and choose through "cvs:pack".

  Hidden on products with a single colour. Without JavaScript the stage is
  the selected colour's photo in a shop window with its name, stock line and
  price; the colour chips do nothing, the buy row stays hidden, and a link
  goes to the buy box ("Choose your phone model"). With reduced motion or no
  WebGL the script still runs the chips, phone list and buttons, without the
  three.js ride or transforms.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'cv-pdp-carousel.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign cvar = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

  comment
    The phone-model option, found the same way as the buy box
    (sections/cv-product-counter.liquid): named like one, or else the first
    option whose values name phones.
  endcomment
  assign model_oi = -1
  for option in product.options_with_values
    assign oname = option.name | downcase
    if oname contains 'model' or oname contains 'phone' or oname contains 'device' or oname contains 'compatib'
      assign model_oi = forloop.index0
      break
    endif
  endfor
  if model_oi == -1
    for option in product.options_with_values
      assign fv = option.values.first | downcase
      if fv contains 'iphone' or fv contains 'galaxy' or fv contains 'pixel' or fv contains 'samsung'
        assign model_oi = forloop.index0
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  comment
    The colour: the first other option with two or more values.
  endcomment
  assign style_oi = -1
  for option in product.options_with_values
    if forloop.index0 != model_oi and option.values.size > 1
      assign style_oi = forloop.index0
      break
    endif
  endfor

  assign model_count = 0
  if model_oi >= 0
    assign model_option = product.options_with_values[model_oi]
    assign model_count = model_option.values.size
  endif

  comment
    A phone counts as chosen only when the shopper chose it: a ?variant= link
    selects one, a plain product URL does not.
  endcomment
  assign confirmed = false
  if product.selected_variant != blank or model_oi == -1 or model_count < 2
    assign confirmed = true
  endif

  assign t_add = 'products.carousel.add' | t
  assign t_buy = 'products.carousel.buy_now' | t
  assign t_placeholder = 'products.buy.model_placeholder' | t
  assign t_pick_model = 'products.buy.choose_model' | t
  assign cta = section.settings.cta_label | default: t_add
  assign cta_pack = section.settings.cta_pack_label | default: 'Add [qty] cases'
  assign buy_label = section.settings.buy_label | default: t_buy
  assign model_placeholder = section.settings.model_placeholder | default: t_placeholder
  assign txt_models_all = section.settings.models_all_text | default: '[n] phone models'
  assign txt_models_some = section.settings.models_some_text | default: '[ok] of [n] phone models'
  assign txt_stock_some = section.settings.stock_some_text | default: 'In stock for [ok] of [n] phone models'
  assign txt_stock = section.settings.stock_text | default: 'In stock'
  assign txt_sold_out = section.settings.sold_out_text | default: 'Sold out in this colour'
  assign show_was = false
  if cvar.compare_at_price > cvar.price
    assign show_was = true
    assign was_off = cvar.compare_at_price | minus: cvar.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: cvar.compare_at_price | round
  endif
-%}

{%- if style_oi >= 0 -%}
  {%- assign style_option = product.options_with_values[style_oi] -%}
  {%- assign style_count = style_option.values.size -%}
  <section class="cvcr" id="cvcr-{{ section.id }}" data-cvcr
           data-money-format="{{ shop.money_format | escape }}"
           aria-labelledby="cvcrTitle-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="cvcr__inner">
      <header class="cvcr__head" data-cvcr-head>
        <h2 class="cvcr__title" id="cvcrTitle-{{ section.id }}" data-cvcr-split>{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- if section.settings.lede != blank -%}
          <p class="cvcr__lede">{{ section.settings.lede | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </header>

      {%- liquid
        assign figs = ''
        assign styles_json = ''
        assign current_index = 0
      -%}
      {%- capture chips -%}
        {%- for value in style_option.values -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign spic = nil
            assign s_ok = 0
            assign s_total = 0
            assign s_tracked = true
            for v in product.variants
              if v.options[style_oi] == value
                assign s_total = s_total | plus: 1
                if v.available
                  assign s_ok = s_ok | plus: 1
                endif
                unless v.inventory_management == 'shopify' and v.inventory_policy == 'deny'
                  assign s_tracked = false
                endunless
                if spic == nil and v.featured_image
                  assign spic = v.featured_image
                endif
              endif
            endfor
            assign is_current = false
            if cvar.options[style_oi] == value
              assign is_current = true
              assign current_index = forloop.index0
            endif
            comment
              image_url is protocol-relative; three.js loads the texture with
              fetch-style CORS, so give it an absolute https URL.
            endcomment
            assign simg = ''
            if spic != nil
              assign simg = spic | image_url: width: 720
              assign simg_head = simg | slice: 0, 2
              if simg_head == '//'
                assign simg = 'https:' | append: simg
              endif
            endif
            assign value_json = value | json
            assign img_json = simg | json
            if forloop.first == false
              assign styles_json = styles_json | append: ','
            endif
            assign styles_json = styles_json | append: '{"value":' | append: value_json | append: ',"img":' | append: img_json | append: ',"ok":' | append: s_ok | append: ',"total":' | append: s_total | append: ',"k":' | append: s_tracked | append: '}'
          -%}
          {%- capture fig -%}
            <figure class="cvcr__still" data-cvcr-still="{{ forloop.index0 }}"{% unless is_current %} hidden{% endunless %}>
              {%- if spic != nil -%}
                {{ spic | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 540, 720, 900', sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 420px, 70vw', alt: value, class: 'cvcr__still-img' }}
              {%- else -%}
                <span class="cvcr__still-art" aria-hidden="true">{%- render 'cv-icon', name: 'device', size: 64 -%}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <figcaption class="cvcr__still-name">{{ value | escape }}</figcaption>
            </figure>
          {%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign figs = figs | append: fig -%}
          <button type="button" class="cvcr__chip" role="radio"
                  aria-checked="{{ is_current }}" tabindex="{% if is_current %}0{% else %}-1{% endif %}"
                  data-cvcr-chip="{{ forloop.index0 }}" data-cvcr-value="{{ value | escape }}"
                  data-stock="{% if s_ok == 0 %}out{% endif %}">
            <span class="cvcr__chip-pic" aria-hidden="true">
              {%- if spic != nil -%}{{ spic | image_url: width: 96 | image_tag: width: 48, height: 48, alt: '', loading: 'lazy' }}{%- endif -%}
            </span>
            <span class="cvcr__chip-name">{{ value | escape }}</span>
          </button>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}

      <div class="cvcr__stage" data-cvcr-stage>
        <div class="cvcr__window" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="cvcr__glow" data-cvcr-glow></span>
          <span class="cvcr__floor"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cvcr__stills" data-cvcr-stills>{{ figs }}</div>
        <div class="cvcr__canvas" data-cvcr-canvas aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <p class="cvcr__hint" data-cvcr-hint hidden>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 13.7-5.6M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-13.7 5.6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M18 3v4h-4M6 21v-4h4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          {{ section.settings.hint | escape }}
        </p>
        <button type="button" class="cvcr__pause" data-cvcr-pause aria-pressed="false" hidden>
          <span data-cvcr-pause-icon="pause">{%- render 'cv-icon', name: 'pause', size: 16 -%}</span>
          <span data-cvcr-pause-icon="play" hidden>{%- render 'cv-icon', name: 'play', size: 16 -%}</span>
          <span class="cvcr__pause-label" data-cvcr-pause-label>{{ section.settings.pause_label | default: 'Pause the ride' | escape }}</span>
        </button>

        <div class="cvcr__nav">
          <button type="button" class="cvcr__arrow cvcr__arrow--prev" data-cvcr-step="-1" aria-controls="cvcrChips-{{ section.id }}">
            <span class="cvcr__sr">{{ section.settings.previous_label | default: 'Previous colour' | escape }}</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </button>
          <p class="cvcr__count" aria-hidden="true"><b data-cvcr-count-now>{{ current_index | plus: 1 | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 }}</b><span>/</span>{{ style_count | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 }}</p>
          <button type="button" class="cvcr__arrow cvcr__arrow--next" data-cvcr-step="1" aria-controls="cvcrChips-{{ section.id }}">
            <span class="cvcr__sr">{{ section.settings.next_label | default: 'Next colour' | escape }}</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cvcr__panel" data-cvcr-panel>
        <div class="cvcr__ticket" data-cvcr-ticket>
          <p class="cvcr__ticket-label">{{ section.settings.pick_label | escape }} <span data-cvcr-count>{{ current_index | plus: 1 }} of {{ style_count }}</span></p>
          <p class="cvcr__name" aria-live="polite"><span data-cvcr-name>{{ cvar.options[style_oi] | escape }}</span></p>
          {%- liquid
            comment
              The stock line. "In stock" needs tracked inventory that stops at zero; an untracked
              or oversold variant is always available, so that colour is "Made for [n] phone models".
            endcomment
            assign cur_ok = 0
            assign cur_total = 0
            assign cur_tracked = true
            for v in product.variants
              if v.options[style_oi] == cvar.options[style_oi]
                assign cur_total = cur_total | plus: 1
                if v.available
                  assign cur_ok = cur_ok | plus: 1
                endif
                unless v.inventory_management == 'shopify' and v.inventory_policy == 'deny'
                  assign cur_tracked = false
                endunless
              endif
            endfor
            assign n_str = cur_total | append: ''
            assign ok_str = cur_ok | append: ''
            assign fit_text = ''
            assign fit_state = 'ok'
            if cur_ok == 0
              assign fit_text = txt_sold_out
              assign fit_state = 'out'
            elsif model_oi < 0
              if cur_tracked
                assign fit_text = txt_stock
              endif
            elsif cur_tracked and cur_ok == cur_total
              assign fit_text = 'products.carousel.in_stock_all' | t
            elsif cur_tracked
              assign fit_text = txt_stock_some | replace: '[ok]', ok_str | replace: '[n]', n_str
            elsif cur_ok == cur_total
              assign fit_models = txt_models_all | replace: '[n]', n_str
              assign fit_text = 'products.carousel.made_for_models' | t: models: fit_models
            else
              assign fit_models = txt_models_some | replace: '[ok]', ok_str | replace: '[n]', n_str
              assign fit_text = 'products.carousel.made_for_models' | t: models: fit_models
            endif
          -%}
          <p class="cvcr__fit" data-cvcr-fit data-state="{{ fit_state }}"{% if fit_text == blank %} hidden{% endif %}>
            <span class="cvcr__fit-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span data-cvcr-fit-text>{{ fit_text | escape }}</span>
          </p>
          <p class="cvcr__price">
            <span class="cvcr__now" data-cvcr-now>{{ cvar.price | money }}</span>
            <s class="cvcr__was" data-cvcr-was{% unless show_was %} hidden{% endunless %}>{% if show_was %}{{ cvar.compare_at_price | money }}{% endif %}</s>
            <span class="cvcr__off" data-cvcr-off{% unless show_was %} hidden{% endunless %}>{% if show_was %}{{ was_off }}% off{% endif %}</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cvcr__chips" id="cvcrChips-{{ section.id }}" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ section.settings.chips_label | escape }}" data-cvcr-chips>
          {{ chips }}
        </div>

        <div class="cvcr__buy" data-cvcr-buy hidden>
          {%- if model_oi >= 0 -%}
            <label class="cvcr__label" for="cvcrModel-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.model_label | escape }}</label>
            <span class="cvcr__select">
              <select id="cvcrModel-{{ section.id }}" data-cvcr-model aria-describedby="cvcrStatus-{{ section.id }}">
                <option value=""{% unless confirmed %} selected{% endunless %}>{{ model_placeholder | escape }}</option>
                {%- for value in model_option.values -%}
                  <option value="{{ value | escape }}"{% if confirmed and cvar.options[model_oi] == value %} selected{% endif %}>{{ value | escape }}</option>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </select>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if section.settings.show_packs -%}
            <div class="cvcr__packs" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ section.settings.packs_label | default: 'Pack' | escape }}" data-cvcr-packs data-cvm-packs hidden>
              <span class="cvcr__packs-hl" data-cvm-pack-highlight aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          <p class="cvcr__pack" data-cvcr-pack hidden>
            <span data-cvcr-pack-text></span>
            <button type="button" class="cvcr__link" data-cvcr-pack-change>{{ section.settings.pack_change_label | escape }}</button>
          </p>
          <button type="button" class="cvcr__add" data-cvcr-add data-cvm-btn>
            <span class="cvcr__add-label" data-cvcr-add-label data-cvm-label>{{ cta | escape }}</span>
            <span class="cvcr__add-total" data-cvcr-add-total></span>
            <svg class="cvcr__add-tick" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-cvm-icon><path d="M5 12.5l4.2 4.2L19 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-cvcr-tick/></svg>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="cvcr__buy-now" data-cvcr-buy-now data-cvm-btn hidden>
            <span class="cvcr__buy-now-label" data-cv-buy-label data-cvm-label data-label-default="{{ buy_label | escape }}">{{ buy_label | escape }}</span>
            <svg class="cvcr__buy-now-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </button>
          <p class="cvcr__status" id="cvcrStatus-{{ section.id }}" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-cvcr-status></p>
        </div>

        <a class="cvcr__back" href="#cvPdp" data-cvcr-nojs>{{ section.settings.nojs_label | escape }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script type="application/json" data-cvcr-data>
      {
        "styleIndex": {{ style_oi }},
        "modelIndex": {{ model_oi }},
        "modelCount": {{ model_count }},
        "confirmed": {{ confirmed }},
        "selected": {{ cvar.options | json }},
        "styles": [{{ styles_json }}],
        "variants": [
          {%- for v in product.variants -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign v_tracked = false
              if v.inventory_management == 'shopify' and v.inventory_policy == 'deny'
                assign v_tracked = true
              endif
            -%}
            {"id":{{ v.id }},"o":{{ v.options | json }},"a":{{ v.available | json }},"k":{{ v_tracked }},"p":{{ v.price }},"c":{{ v.compare_at_price | default: 0 }}}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
          {%- endfor -%}
        ],
        "t": {
          "add": {{ cta | json }},
          "addPack": {{ cta_pack | json }},
          "buy": {{ buy_label | json }},
          "adding": {{ 'products.buy.adding' | t | json }},
          "added": {{ 'products.buy.added' | t | json }},
          "soldOut": {{ 'products.buy.sold_out' | t | json }},
          "unavailable": {{ 'products.buy.unavailable' | t | json }},
          "pickModel": {{ section.settings.pick_model_text | default: t_pick_model | json }},
          "failed": {{ 'products.buy.error' | t | json }},
          "count": "[i] of [n]",
          "madeFor": {{ 'products.carousel.made_for_models' | t: models: '[models]' | json }},
          "stockAll": {{ 'products.carousel.in_stock_all' | t | json }},
          "modelsAll": {{ txt_models_all | json }},
          "modelsSome": {{ txt_models_some | json }},
          "stockSome": {{ txt_stock_some | json }},
          "stock": {{ txt_stock | json }},
          "fitNone": {{ txt_sold_out | json }},
          "fitYours": {{ section.settings.yours_stock_text | default: 'In stock for your [model]' | json }},
          "fitYoursOut": {{ section.settings.yours_out_text | default: 'Sold out for your [model] in this colour' | json }},
          "fitYoursNone": {{ section.settings.yours_none_text | default: 'Not made for your [model] in this colour' | json }},
          "soldSuffix": {{ 'general.quick_pick.sold_out_suffix' | t | json }},
          "noneSuffix": " (not in this colour)",
          "pack": "Pack of [qty] · [total] · [pct]% off",
          "packPlain": "Pack of [qty] · [total]",
          "off": "[pct]% off",
          "pause": {{ section.settings.pause_label | default: 'Pause the ride' | json }},
          "play": {{ section.settings.play_label | default: 'Start the ride' | json }}
        }
      }
    </script>
  </section>
{%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
  <section class="cvcr cvcr--note">
    <p class="cvcr__editor-note">Colour carousel: this product has a single colour, so the carousel stays hidden here. It shows on products made in two or more colours.</p>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product: colour carousel",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "section-cv-pdp-carousel",
  "enabled_on": { "templates": ["product"] },
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Every colour of the product rides a 3D carousel. Picking a colour, phone and adding to bag all go through the buy box, so the price and pack always match it. Hidden on products with one colour." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Take your pick of the carousel" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "lede", "label": "Text", "default": "Every colour this case comes in rides past. Tap one or drag to spin, choose your phone, and it’s ready for your bag." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hint", "label": "Drag hint", "default": "Drag to spin" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Choosing" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pick_label", "label": "Colour ticket label", "default": "Your colour" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "chips_label", "label": "Colour list name (screen readers)", "default": "Colour" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "model_label", "label": "Phone label", "default": "Your phone" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "model_placeholder", "label": "Phone placeholder", "default": "Choose your phone model", "info": "Leave blank for the store default. A phone model is never chosen for the shopper." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pick_model_text", "label": "Reminder when no phone is chosen", "default": "Pick your phone model first, so the case fits." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Stock line" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "In stock shows only for variants whose inventory Shopify tracks and that stop selling at zero. Other variants say Made for the number of phone models. [n] is the number of phone models, [ok] the ones still available, [model] the shopper's phone." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "models_all_text", "label": "Phone models, all available", "default": "[n] phone models", "info": "Shown after Made for." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "models_some_text", "label": "Phone models, some available", "default": "[ok] of [n] phone models", "info": "Shown after Made for." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "stock_some_text", "label": "Tracked stock, some phone models", "default": "In stock for [ok] of [n] phone models" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "stock_text", "label": "Tracked stock, no phone models", "default": "In stock" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sold_out_text", "label": "Sold out in this colour", "default": "Sold out in this colour" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "yours_stock_text", "label": "Tracked stock, shopper's phone", "default": "In stock for your [model]" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "yours_out_text", "label": "Sold out for the shopper's phone", "default": "Sold out for your [model] in this colour" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "yours_none_text", "label": "Not made for the shopper's phone", "default": "Not made for your [model] in this colour" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Button" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_label", "label": "Button label", "default": "Add to bag" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_pack_label", "label": "Button label for a pack", "default": "Add [qty] cases", "info": "[qty] is the number of cases in the pack chosen in the buy box." },
